: comment Compiled using Eoghan's flap to clac compiler https://github.com/Eoghanmc22/flap-compiler ;

: comment flap source code:
    if (true) {
      print(1)
    }
    if (true) {
      print(2)
    }
    if (true) {
      print(3)
    }
    if (true) {
      print(4)
    }
    if (true) {
      print(5)
    }
;

: comment Check that the clac interperter is using the correct native width ;
64 width_native - if -100 print quit

: comment Start Definitions ;
: func-on_true-0 1 print ;
: func-on_true-2 2 print ;
: func-on_true-4 3 print ;
: func-on_true-6 4 print ;
: func-on_true-8 5 print ;

: comment Start Main ;
1 if func-on_true-0 0 skip 1 if func-on_true-2 0 skip 1 if func-on_true-4 0 skip 1 if func-on_true-6 0 skip 1 if func-on_true-8 0 skip